{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：04:23 2026-10-22 HKT<br/>發佈時間：04:23 2026-10-22 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：04:23 2026-10-22 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0b1e7552d10c4469d8236060838ceb8d/2026-10/RTC_1.jpeg\"/><p>金鐘發生酒後駕駛事件。昨晚（21日）10時23分，一輛私家車沿夏慤道往中環方向行駛，駛至近夏慤花園對開時，失事撞向路中石壆，繼而翻側。</p><p>警方接報到場，發現司機身上有酒氣，經初步調查後，姓黃（34歲）男司機未能通過酒精呼氣測試，遂以涉嫌酒後駕駛將其拘捕。</p><p>事件中，黃男司機胸口疼痛，清醒由救護車送往律敦治醫院治理。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T00:41:03.641229+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":239,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T20:23:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T01:18:04.881298+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T00:37:47.719381+00:00","content_hash":"1a38aec72903d4c2bb312af69138d1090fb612cef5452c845e0beec04f5caebe","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}